      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7105104",
      "subQuestName": "Tell Khedive about what happened by the water",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710500801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710500801": {
            "id": "710500801",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "About the strange object by the water...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500802"
            ]
          },
          "710500802": {
            "id": "710500802",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "Huh? Have you placed it by the water?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500803"
            ]
          },
          "710500803": {
            "id": "710500803",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "How is it? Did anything special happen?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500804"
            ]
          },
          "710500804": {
            "id": "710500804",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "A Geovishap showed up.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500805"
            ]
          },
          "710500805": {
            "id": "710500805",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "A Geovishap? It turned into a Geovishap in the water!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500806"
            ]
          },
          "710500806": {
            "id": "710500806",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "Oh, you mean that it didn't turn into a Geovishap, but rather, attracted one over.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500807"
            ]
          },
          "710500807": {
            "id": "710500807",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "My heart almost stopped there! If it really had turned into a Geovishap, my whole world-view would have been shattered.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500808"
            ]
          },
          "710500808": {
            "id": "710500808",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "So what exactly is that thing?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500809"
            ]
          },
          "710500809": {
            "id": "710500809",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "The answer is simple. How should I put it? Mmm, well why don't you tell me first if there was anything special about that Geovishap?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500810"
            ]
          },
          "710500810": {
            "id": "710500810",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "Did it, say, wield Hydro?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500812",
              "710500814"
            ]
          },
          "710500812": {
            "id": "710500812",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "That's about right.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500816"
            ]
          },
          "710500816": {
            "id": "710500816",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "That Geovishap is probably able to use Hydro.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500817"
            ]
          },
          "710500817": {
            "id": "710500817",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "The groundwater in The Chasm contains dense Hydro energies. As such, certain high-concentration spots have become the nurturing grounds for the waterweed-like object that you fished up.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500818"
            ]
          },
          "710500818": {
            "id": "710500818",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "The Geovishap — and other water-loving creatures in The Chasm, too — has increased its power by feeding on these waterweeds that are rich in Hydro.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500819"
            ]
          },
          "710500819": {
            "id": "710500819",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "So that thing is... just some waterweed rich in Hydro elements!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500820"
            ]
          },
          "710500820": {
            "id": "710500820",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Just some waterweed, huh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500821"
            ]
          },
          "710500821": {
            "id": "710500821",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "Yep, waterweed — only that it contains exceedingly dense Hydro elemental energy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500822"
            ]
          },
          "710500822": {
            "id": "710500822",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "You don't usually find it in ordinary environments — unless some immense, pure power has altered the source of the water... Forget it, these waterweeds...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500823"
            ]
          },
          "710500823": {
            "id": "710500823",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "It could turn into sentient elemental beings one day. You know what? This would make a fine research topic."
          },
          "710500814": {
            "id": "710500814",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "#You must've taken it out too quickly to notice its special trait. How impressive, as expected of the legendary {NICKNAME}.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710500815"
            ]
          },
          "710500815": {
            "id": "710500815",
            "speakerId": 2618,
            "speakerName": "Khedive",
            "text": "But here's my hypothesis..."
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}